{"seq":2,"slug":"dupont-analysis","title":"大学会计学 — 杜邦分析体系","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/accounting/financial-statements-analysis/dupont-analysis","wordCount":1803,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"大学会计学-杜邦分析体系\">大学会计学 — 杜邦分析体系</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>净资产收益率（ROE）是投资者最关心的单一指标，它衡量股东每投入 1 元钱能赚回多少利润。但一个孤立的 ROE 数字（比如 15%）只告诉你&quot;结果&quot;，没告诉你&quot;为什么&quot;——这个回报是靠高利润率赚来的，还是靠快周转、抑或是靠高负债撬动的？杜邦分析（DuPont Analysis）正是为了回答这个&quot;为什么&quot;而生。它由美国杜邦公司在 20 世纪初首创，把 ROE 拆解成几个具有清晰经营含义的因子，让我们看清一家企业盈利能力的真正来源。</p>\n<p>杜邦分析的威力在于它把财务分析从&quot;看结果&quot;提升到&quot;看驱动因素&quot;。两家公司可能有相同的 ROE，但盈利模式可能天差地别：一家是高端奢侈品（高利润率、低周转、低杠杆），一家是大型商超（低利润率、高周转、适中杠杆）。杜邦分解让这些不同的商业模式一目了然，是连接财务数字与商业战略的桥梁。</p>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"经典三因子分解\">经典三因子分解</h3><p>杜邦分析的核心公式把 ROE 拆成三个因子：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>R</mi><mi>O</mi><mi>E</mi><mo>=</mo><munder><munder><mfrac><mtext>净利润</mtext><mtext>营业收入</mtext></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"true\">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>净利率</mtext></munder><mo>×</mo><munder><munder><mfrac><mtext>营业收入</mtext><mtext>平均总资产</mtext></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"true\">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>总资产周转率</mtext></munder><mo>×</mo><munder><munder><mfrac><mtext>平均总资产</mtext><mtext>平均净资产</mtext></mfrac><mo stretchy=\"true\">⏟</mo></munder><mtext>权益乘数</mtext></munder></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">ROE = \\underbrace{\\frac{净利润}{营业收入}}_{净利率} \\times \\underbrace{\\frac{营业收入}{平均总资产}}_{总资产周转率} \\times \\underbrace{\\frac{平均总资产}{平均净资产}}_{权益乘数}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0077em;\">R</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.3727em;vertical-align:-2.0123em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.348em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.3603em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">净利率</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.3603em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.3603em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.0263em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.3603em;\"></span><span class=\"stretchy\" style=\"height:0.548em;min-width:1.6em;\"><span class=\"brace-left\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 6l6-6h17c12.688 0 19.313.3 20 1 4 4 7.313 8.3 10 13\n 35.313 51.3 80.813 93.8 136.5 127.5 55.688 33.7 117.188 55.8 184.5 66.5.688\n 0 2 .3 4 1 18.688 2.7 76 4.3 172 5h399450v120H429l-6-1c-124.688-8-235-61.7\n-331-161C60.687 138.7 32.312 99.3 7 54L0 41V6z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-center\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMin slice\"><path d=\"M199572 214\nc100.7 8.3 195.3 44 280 108 55.3 42 101.7 93 139 153l9 14c2.7-4 5.7-8.7 9-14\n 53.3-86.7 123.7-153 211-199 66.7-36 137.3-56.3 212-62h199568v120H200432c-178.3\n 11.7-311.7 78.3-403 201-6 8-9.7 12-11 12-.7.7-6.7 1-18 1s-17.3-.3-18-1c-1.3 0\n-5-4-11-12-44.7-59.3-101.3-106.3-170-141s-145.3-54.3-229-60H0V214z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-right\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M399994 0l6 6v35l-6 11c-56 104-135.3 181.3-238 232-57.3\n 28.7-117 45-179 50H-300V214h399897c43.3-7 81-15 113-26 100.7-33 179.7-91 237\n-174 2.7-5 6-9 10-13 .7-1 7.3-1 20-1h17z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.3603em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.3603em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">营业收入</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">净利润</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.334em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.0123em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.3727em;vertical-align:-2.0123em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.348em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.3603em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">总资产周转率</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.3603em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.3603em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.0263em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.3603em;\"></span><span class=\"stretchy\" style=\"height:0.548em;min-width:1.6em;\"><span class=\"brace-left\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 6l6-6h17c12.688 0 19.313.3 20 1 4 4 7.313 8.3 10 13\n 35.313 51.3 80.813 93.8 136.5 127.5 55.688 33.7 117.188 55.8 184.5 66.5.688\n 0 2 .3 4 1 18.688 2.7 76 4.3 172 5h399450v120H429l-6-1c-124.688-8-235-61.7\n-331-161C60.687 138.7 32.312 99.3 7 54L0 41V6z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-center\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMin slice\"><path d=\"M199572 214\nc100.7 8.3 195.3 44 280 108 55.3 42 101.7 93 139 153l9 14c2.7-4 5.7-8.7 9-14\n 53.3-86.7 123.7-153 211-199 66.7-36 137.3-56.3 212-62h199568v120H200432c-178.3\n 11.7-311.7 78.3-403 201-6 8-9.7 12-11 12-.7.7-6.7 1-18 1s-17.3-.3-18-1c-1.3 0\n-5-4-11-12-44.7-59.3-101.3-106.3-170-141s-145.3-54.3-229-60H0V214z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-right\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M399994 0l6 6v35l-6 11c-56 104-135.3 181.3-238 232-57.3\n 28.7-117 45-179 50H-300V214h399897c43.3-7 81-15 113-26 100.7-33 179.7-91 237\n-174 2.7-5 6-9 10-13 .7-1 7.3-1 20-1h17z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.3603em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.3603em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">平均总资产</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">营业收入</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.334em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.0123em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:3.3727em;vertical-align:-2.0123em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.348em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.3603em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">权益乘数</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.3603em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.3603em;\"></span><span class=\"minner munder\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.0263em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.3603em;\"></span><span class=\"stretchy\" style=\"height:0.548em;min-width:1.6em;\"><span class=\"brace-left\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 6l6-6h17c12.688 0 19.313.3 20 1 4 4 7.313 8.3 10 13\n 35.313 51.3 80.813 93.8 136.5 127.5 55.688 33.7 117.188 55.8 184.5 66.5.688\n 0 2 .3 4 1 18.688 2.7 76 4.3 172 5h399450v120H429l-6-1c-124.688-8-235-61.7\n-331-161C60.687 138.7 32.312 99.3 7 54L0 41V6z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-center\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMin slice\"><path d=\"M199572 214\nc100.7 8.3 195.3 44 280 108 55.3 42 101.7 93 139 153l9 14c2.7-4 5.7-8.7 9-14\n 53.3-86.7 123.7-153 211-199 66.7-36 137.3-56.3 212-62h199568v120H200432c-178.3\n 11.7-311.7 78.3-403 201-6 8-9.7 12-11 12-.7.7-6.7 1-18 1s-17.3-.3-18-1c-1.3 0\n-5-4-11-12-44.7-59.3-101.3-106.3-170-141s-145.3-54.3-229-60H0V214z\"/></svg></span><span class=\"brace-right\" style=\"height:0.548em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.548em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 548\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M399994 0l6 6v35l-6 11c-56 104-135.3 181.3-238 232-57.3\n 28.7-117 45-179 50H-300V214h399897c43.3-7 81-15 113-26 100.7-33 179.7-91 237\n-174 2.7-5 6-9 10-13 .7-1 7.3-1 20-1h17z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.3603em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3.3603em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">平均净资产</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">平均总资产</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.334em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:2.0123em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>三个因子分别对应三种截然不同的盈利驱动力：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>因子</th>\n<th>公式</th>\n<th>反映的能力</th>\n<th>通俗解释</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>净利率</td>\n<td>净利润 / 营业收入</td>\n<td>盈利能力</td>\n<td>卖得贵不贵、赚得厚不厚</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>总资产周转率</td>\n<td>营业收入 / 平均总资产</td>\n<td>营运能力</td>\n<td>资产转得快不快、卖得勤不勤</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>权益乘数</td>\n<td>平均总资产 / 平均净资产</td>\n<td>财务杠杆</td>\n<td>借了多少别人的钱来放大回报</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>权益乘数 = 总资产 / 净资产 = <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mtext>资产负债率</mtext></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{1}{1 - 资产负债率}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2484em;vertical-align:-0.4033em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">资产负债率</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.4033em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span>。负债越多，权益乘数越大，对 ROE 的放大作用越强——但杠杆是双刃剑，放大收益的同时也放大风险。</p>\n<h3 id=\"三种商业模式的对比\">三种商业模式的对比</h3><p>用三家虚构但贴近现实的公司展示同一 ROE 的不同来源（假设三家 ROE 都约等于 15%）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>公司类型</th>\n<th>净利率</th>\n<th>总资产周转率</th>\n<th>权益乘数</th>\n<th>ROE</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>奢侈品牌</td>\n<td>25%</td>\n<td>0.5</td>\n<td>1.2</td>\n<td>15%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>大型商超</td>\n<td>2%</td>\n<td>3.0</td>\n<td>2.5</td>\n<td>15%</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>重资产银行</td>\n<td>高利差</td>\n<td>极低</td>\n<td>很高（10倍以上）</td>\n<td>类似</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>奢侈品牌（类似爱马仕）靠的是极高的利润率——东西卖得贵、单价利润厚，但资产周转慢、几乎不用负债。大型商超（类似沃尔玛）净利率薄如刀片，靠的是惊人的周转速度——薄利多销，一年把资产卖好几轮，并辅以适度杠杆。银行则高度依赖财务杠杆，用很高的权益乘数撬动回报。<strong>同样 15% 的 ROE，背后是三种完全不同的生意</strong>。杜邦分析让你一眼看穿一家公司&quot;靠什么吃饭&quot;。</p>\n<h3 id=\"分解的诊断流程\">分解的诊断流程</h3><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[ROE 变化了] --&gt; B{拆解三因子}&#10;    B --&gt; C[净利率变化?]&#10;    B --&gt; D[周转率变化?]&#10;    B --&gt; E[权益乘数变化?]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[毛利率? 费用率? 税率?]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[存货周转? 应收周转? 资产闲置?]&#10;    E --&gt; E1[负债增加? 是良性扩张还是风险累积?]\">graph TD\n    A[ROE 变化了] --&gt; B{拆解三因子}\n    B --&gt; C[净利率变化?]\n    B --&gt; D[周转率变化?]\n    B --&gt; E[权益乘数变化?]\n    C --&gt; C1[毛利率? 费用率? 税率?]\n    D --&gt; D1[存货周转? 应收周转? 资产闲置?]\n    E --&gt; E1[负债增加? 是良性扩张还是风险累积?]</pre><p>当一家公司 ROE 下滑时，杜邦分析告诉你该往哪儿查。例如 ROE 从 18% 降到 12%，拆解后发现净利率和周转率都稳定，唯独权益乘数从 2.5 降到 1.7——说明 ROE 下降是因为公司主动降低了负债（去杠杆），这其实是财务更稳健的表现，而非经营恶化。反之，如果是净利率从 10% 暴跌到 5% 导致的，那就要深挖是降价、成本上升还是费用失控。<strong>同样的 ROE 下降，原因不同，结论可能截然相反</strong>——这正是杜邦分析的诊断价值。</p>\n<h3 id=\"一个真实计算示例\">一个真实计算示例</h3><p>某公司：净利润 600 万、营业收入 6000 万、平均总资产 8000 万、平均净资产 4000 万。</p>\n<ul>\n<li>净利率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>600</mn><mn>6000</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">= \\frac{600}{6000} = 10\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1901em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">6000</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">600</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10%</span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li>总资产周转率 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>6000</mn><mn>8000</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>0.75</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">= \\frac{6000}{8000} = 0.75</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1901em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">8000</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">6000</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.75</span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li>权益乘数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>8000</mn><mn>4000</mn></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2.0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">= \\frac{8000}{4000} = 2.0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1901em;vertical-align:-0.345em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8451em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.655em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4000</span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.394em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">8000</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.345em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.0</span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li>ROE <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mo>×</mo><mn>0.75</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>2.0</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>15</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">= 10\\% \\times 0.75 \\times 2.0 = 15\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.3669em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10%</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.75</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.0</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">15%</span></span></span></span></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>假设次年公司通过提价使净利率升至 12%，其他不变，则 ROE 升至 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>12</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mo>×</mo><mn>0.75</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>2.0</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>18</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">12\\% \\times 0.75 \\times 2.0 = 18\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">12%</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.75</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.0</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">18%</span></span></span></span></span>，ROE 的改善完全来自盈利能力提升——这是高质量的增长。若改为靠增加负债把权益乘数提到 2.4 来实现 18%（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>10</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi><mo>×</mo><mn>0.75</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>2.4</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>18</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10\\% \\times 0.75 \\times 2.4 = 18\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10%</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.75</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.4</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">18%</span></span></span></span></span>），则增长是靠加杠杆&quot;买&quot;来的，风险更高。这就是杜邦分析帮助我们区分&quot;增长质量&quot;的方式。</p>\n<h3 id=\"杜邦分析的延伸\">杜邦分析的延伸</h3><p>杜邦体系还可以进一步五因子分解，把净利率拆成&quot;税负、利息负担、经营利润率&quot;等，更精细地定位问题。但对自学者而言，掌握经典三因子并养成&quot;看到 ROE 就本能去拆解&quot;的习惯，已经足以让你对企业盈利模式形成深刻洞察。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li>用一句话说明杜邦分析相比直接看 ROE 的核心价值是什么。</li>\n<li>写出 ROE 三因子分解公式，并解释每个因子分别反映企业的什么能力。</li>\n<li>两家公司 ROE 都是 20%：A 净利率 20%、周转率 0.4、权益乘数 2.5；B 净利率 4%、周转率 2.5、权益乘数 2.0。分别判断它们可能属于什么类型的行业，并说明理由。</li>\n<li>某公司 ROE 从 16% 升到 20%，拆解后发现净利率和周转率不变，权益乘数从 2.0 升到 2.5。这种 ROE 提升你认为是高质量的吗？为什么？</li>\n<li>权益乘数为什么被称为&quot;双刃剑&quot;？在经济下行、利率上升的环境中，高权益乘数的企业面临什么风险？</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>用东方财富或雪球查看任意一家公司的&quot;杜邦分析&quot;图（多数平台已内置），对照本节理解各因子</li>\n<li>对比爱马仕（或茅台）与沃尔玛（或永辉超市）的三因子分解，亲身感受不同商业模式的财务画像</li>\n<li>巴菲特历年致股东信中对 ROE 与杠杆的论述，理解为什么他偏爱&quot;不靠高杠杆就能维持高 ROE&quot;的公司</li>\n<li>实践建议：选一家公司连续五年做杜邦分解，画出三个因子的变化趋势线，你会比任何文字描述都更懂这家公司的盈利演变</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>杜邦分析把 ROE 拆解为净利率、总资产周转率和权益乘数三个因子，分别对应盈利能力、营运能力和财务杠杆三种驱动力。相同的 ROE 可能来自完全不同的商业模式：高利润率的奢侈品、高周转的商超、高杠杆的金融。杜邦分析的核心价值是把分析从&quot;看结果&quot;提升到&quot;看驱动因素&quot;，并帮助判断 ROE 变化的真正原因与增长质量，是连接财务数字与商业战略的桥梁。下一节我们将回到现金流，学习如何识别利润与现金背离背后的风险。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"大学会计学 — 杜邦分析体系","id":"大学会计学-杜邦分析体系"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"经典三因子分解","id":"经典三因子分解"},{"level":3,"text":"三种商业模式的对比","id":"三种商业模式的对比"},{"level":3,"text":"分解的诊断流程","id":"分解的诊断流程"},{"level":3,"text":"一个真实计算示例","id":"一个真实计算示例"},{"level":3,"text":"杜邦分析的延伸","id":"杜邦分析的延伸"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"大学会计学 — 财务比率分析","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/accounting/financial-statements-analysis/financial-ratios"},"next":{"title":"大学会计学 — 现金流分析与盈利质量","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/management/accounting/financial-statements-analysis/cash-flow-analysis"}}